            "title": "美股｜科技股再遭拋售 納指跌2.2% Anthropic掛牌翌日瀉12%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜科技股再遭拋售 納指跌2.2% Anthropic掛牌翌日瀉12%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜科技股再遭拋售 納指跌2.2% Anthropic掛牌翌日瀉12%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國科技股新一輪沽壓持續，納斯達克綜合指數周四下滑2.2%，周五跌勢進一步擴大。人工智能公司Anthropic上市首日曾高見111.5美元，較83美元招股價高34%，惟收市報97.17美元，升幅收窄至17%，市值約1.28萬億美元。該股周五午後下挫12%，投資者趁高獲利。Yorkville Ives合夥人艾夫斯認為，是次拋售由「完美風暴」造成，涉及政治、監管、流動性及通脹等多項因素。</p></div>",
