            "title": "國際｜GTA6登場搶焦點 Ubisoft旺季收入預測遠遜估計 股價盤中瀉21%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜GTA6登場搶焦點 Ubisoft旺季收入預測遠遜估計 股價盤中瀉21%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/616f0ec9de9bd5e8d7347b61a0073cd0f87aa623da92ff7e3eadbb2565717b9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜GTA6登場搶焦點 Ubisoft旺季收入預測遠遜估計 股價盤中瀉21%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">遊戲開發商Ubisoft在巴黎泛歐交易所掛牌的股價盤中急瀉21%，低見3.31歐元。公司預期10月至12月的淨預訂收入約2.5億歐元，遠低於市場估計的3.61億歐元，亦不及去年同期的3.38億歐元。Ubisoft上半財年淨訂量按年下跌16.5%，第二季淨預訂收入3.89億歐元則優於指引。市場焦點落在相隔13年推出的《Grand Theft Auto VI》，其發行商Rockstar Games母公司Take-Two美股盤前曾升近2%。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-d4f9b646-a4c8-3263-a1af-e65513212313-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-